---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

import '@/styles/reset.css';
import '@/styles/variables.css';
import '@/styles/base.css';
import '@/styles/layout.css';
import '@/styles/components.css';
import '@/styles/components/buttons/button.css';
import '@/styles/pages/terms.css';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Terms and Conditions | Tekevol"
  description="The terms that apply when you use tekevol.com, submit a form, or book a call with Tekevol."
>
  <main id="main" class="legal">
      <section class="legal-hero">
        <div class="container legal-hero__inner">
          <p class="legal-hero__eyebrow">Legal</p>
          <h1>Terms and Conditions</h1>
          <p class="legal-hero__updated">Last updated: <time datetime="2026-10-22">October 22, 2026</time></p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="container legal-layout">
        <nav class="legal-toc" aria-label="On this page">
          <p class="legal-toc__title">On this page</p>
          <ol>
            <li><a href="#acceptance">Agreeing to these terms</a></li>
            <li><a href="#about">About Tekevol</a></li>
            <li><a href="#services">Services and pricing</a></li>
            <li><a href="#forms">Forms and how we contact you</a></li>
            <li><a href="#calls">Booking a call</a></li>
            <li><a href="#use">Using this site</a></li>
            <li><a href="#ip">Our content</a></li>
            <li><a href="#third-party">Third-party services and links</a></li>
            <li><a href="#privacy">Privacy</a></li>
            <li><a href="#disclaimer">Disclaimer</a></li>
            <li><a href="#liability">Limitation of liability</a></li>
            <li><a href="#indemnity">Your responsibility</a></li>
            <li><a href="#law">Governing law</a></li>
            <li><a href="#changes">Changes to these terms</a></li>
            <li><a href="#contact">Contact us</a></li>
          </ol>
        </nav>

        <article class="legal-content">
          <section id="acceptance">
            <h2>1. Agreeing to these terms</h2>
            <p>These terms apply to anyone who visits tekevol.com (the "site"). By using the site, filling out a form, or booking a call, you agree to these terms. If you don't agree, please don't use the site.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="about">
            <h2>2. About Tekevol</h2>
            <p>Tekevol ("Tekevol," "we," "us," or "our") builds and manages websites for small businesses, including trade and service businesses. In these terms, "you" means the person using the site, or the business they represent.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="services">
            <h2>3. Services and pricing</h2>
            <p>The packages, features, and prices shown on this site, including Activate, Evolve, and Ascend, are for general information. They are not an offer or a contract.</p>
            <p>When you hire us, the exact scope, price, timeline, and payment terms are set in a written proposal or service agreement. If that agreement says something different from this site, the agreement controls.</p>
            <p>We may change our packages and prices at any time. A change won't affect work already covered by a signed agreement.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="forms">
            <h2>4. Forms and how we contact you</h2>
            <p>When you send us a quote request or contact form, you agree that the information you give is accurate and that you're allowed to share it.</p>
            <p>You also agree that we may contact you by email or phone about your request. We won't add you to a marketing list just because you filled out a form, and you can ask us to stop contacting you at any time by emailing <a href="mailto:support@tekevol.com">support@tekevol.com</a>.</p>
            <p>Sending a form doesn't create a business relationship or require either of us to work together.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="calls">
            <h2>5. Booking a call</h2>
            <p>Free calls are scheduled through HubSpot's meeting tool and held on Google Meet. Calls are free and carry no obligation. We may need to reschedule or decline a booking, and we'll let you know by email if we do. You can cancel or reschedule using the link in your confirmation email.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="use">
            <h2>6. Using this site</h2>
            <p>You may use this site to learn about our services and get in touch with us. You agree not to:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Send spam, fake, or automated form submissions</li>
              <li>Give false information or pretend to be someone else</li>
              <li>Try to hack, overload, or disrupt the site or the services it runs on</li>
              <li>Copy or scrape the site's content with bots or other automated tools</li>
              <li>Use the site for anything illegal</li>
            </ul>
            <p>We may block access to anyone who breaks these rules.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="ip">
            <h2>7. Our content</h2>
            <p>The text, design, graphics, logo, and other content on this site belong to Tekevol or are used with permission. You may view and share links to our pages, but you may not copy, republish, or sell our content without our written permission.</p>
            <p>Any client names, logos, or work shown on the site belong to their owners and appear with their permission.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="third-party">
            <h2>8. Third-party services and links</h2>
            <p>This site uses outside services, including HubSpot, Google Tag Manager, Google Analytics, and Google Meet, and it may link to other websites. We don't control those services or sites and aren't responsible for their content, availability, or practices. Their own terms and privacy policies apply when you use them.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="privacy">
            <h2>9. Privacy</h2>
            <p>Our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> explains what information we collect through this site, including through cookies, and how we use it.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="disclaimer">
            <h2>10. Disclaimer</h2>
            <p>This site and its content are provided "as is" and "as available." We work to keep information accurate and the site running, but we don't promise that the site will always be available, error-free, or secure.</p>
            <p>Information on this site is general and isn't a guarantee of any result. We don't promise specific outcomes such as search rankings, website traffic, leads, or revenue.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="liability">
            <h2>11. Limitation of liability</h2>
            <p>To the fullest extent the law allows, Tekevol is not liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages, or for lost profits, data, or business, that come from your use of this site or your inability to use it.</p>
            <p>This section covers your use of the website only. Liability for paid work is covered by the service agreement for that work.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="indemnity">
            <h2>12. Your responsibility</h2>
            <p>If you misuse this site or break these terms, and that leads to a claim against Tekevol, you agree to cover the reasonable costs of that claim, including legal fees.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="law">
            <h2>13. Governing law</h2>
            <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Illinois, without regard to its conflict-of-law rules. Any dispute about these terms or this site will be handled in the state or federal courts located in Illinois.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="changes">
            <h2>14. Changes to these terms</h2>
            <p>We may update these terms from time to time. When we do, we'll change the "Last updated" date at the top of this page. Using the site after a change means you accept the updated terms.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="contact">
            <h2>15. Contact us</h2>
            <p>Questions about these terms? Email us at <a href="mailto:support@tekevol.com">support@tekevol.com</a>.</p>
          </section>
        </article>
      </div>
    </main>
</BaseLayout>
